June 14 -- 16, 2004
 * (All files) Extensive rewriting, cleanup. Particularly
  - (pair.*) pair inlined, members made private, operators rewritten
  - (triple.h) members made private, operators rewritten
  - (lengths.*) raw_len removed (use "norm" instead)
